{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_22\">Problem 22</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 22\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d24533975de7c41e63b4e97fd5556f5855323b54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+m)^2-(x+n)^2=(m-n)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"251\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are unequal non-zero constants, is satisfied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/f/c8f672c1c259c686b802c0aece598d093756c305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=am+bn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />, where:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/7/3a78d7cd39d888aed3e8b10094e043909b4f7656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a = 0, b \\text{ } \\text{has a unique non-zero value}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ a = 0, b \\text{ } \\text{has two non-zero values}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ b = 0, a \\text{ } \\text{has a unique non-zero value}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ b = 0, a \\text{ } \\text{has two non-zero values}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ a \\text{ } \\text{and} \\text{ } b \\text{ } \\text{each have a unique non-zero value}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"341\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expand binomials, combine like terms, and subtract terms from both sides.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f18869d615555d86d01482370840d296e1eefa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + 2xm + m^2 - x^2 - 2xn - n^2 = m^2 - 2mn + n^2\\]\" width=\"399\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/4/124c5d167e6aefa5f56e09695552f9f36b536287.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2xm + m^2 - 2xn - n^2 = m^2 - 2mn + n^2\\]\" width=\"319\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df4f03ae96919515298161ec00424b31756f57e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2xm - 2xn - n^2 = -2mn + n^2\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"16\" />\nGet all the x-terms on one side and factor to solve for x.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8dccaca5041f98e839590ab5b9b5e9b336934ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2xm - 2xn = -2mn + 2n^2\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/95552b0a1171b8736cd7fb11dd9fc6a3ecd1b394.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x(m-n) = -2n(m-n)\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b8d3144371cc0ddcf98b327bf2a4a6874b0983c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\not= n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, both sides can be divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/c/eec521c60534fed80cc321be32e7347f785c145d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-n$\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/046352b7a4aa39e43beff02c3f5b93f59f7392df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = -n\\]\" width=\"58\" height=\"8\" />\nThat means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5969c2cfb1ffadf981fbbddcf796c8eb0037546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f0e5287f11dc65e3f81673742d580064d9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" 